 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Do you have a good signal at the base of the stairs where it drops? If so, move there for calls. Also try each end of house just doing the backbone if you're running it together. Go to the middle floor and plug in small power drill with wire still in your hand. Keep the drill running and follow it up the stairs. He' get faster as he gets better. For now, ask him how the calls work and if he'd rather a quick voice. Most kids do after a few of them. It' worth it. You' be talking on the phone at the top of the stairs before you believe.",
